ite structure and educational information that students can use to plan their next steps.",{"children":"He is a Hafiz and has three years of experience in search engine optimization. His work brings together an interest in technology, clear website structure and educational information that students can use to plan their next steps."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","nav",null,{"className":"answer-links","aria-label":"Next steps for Who is Hafiz Umar Farooq?","children":[["$","$L4","https://www.linkedin.com/in/umar-farooq-838337418/",{"href":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/umar-farooq-838337418/","children":["View Umar’s LinkedIn profile",["$","$L5",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$6:props:children:2:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}],["$","$L4","mailto:umarfarooq360official@gmail.com",{"href":"mailto:umarfarooq360official@gmail.com","children":["Email Umar directly",["$","$L5",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$6:props:children:2:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}]]}]]}],["$","section","1-His role at AspireCompass",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-2","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"His role at AspireCompass"}],[["$","p","As founder and CEO, Umar leads the direction of AspireCompass. As editor, he is the named contact for editorial questions, corrections and feedback about the website’s coverage and presentation.",{"children":"As founder and CEO, Umar leads the direction of AspireCompass. As editor, he is the named contact for editorial questions, corrections and feedback about the website’s coverage and presentation."}],["$","p","AspireCompass guides are published under the organization’s editorial identity unless a page explicitly identifies an individual author. His profile makes the editorial contact visible and gives readers a direct way to raise questions about the site.",{"children":"AspireCompass guides are published under the organization’s editorial identity unless a page explicitly identifies an individual author. His profile makes the editorial contact visible and gives readers a direct way to raise questions about the site."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$L1a","$undefined","$undefined","$L1b"]}],"$L1c","$L1d","$L1e"]}],false,null,"$L1f"]}],"$L20"]}]
